{"title": "Fishfolk Faithful", "pageid": 45144, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fishfolk_Faithful", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fishfolk Faithful</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invigorating_Fanaticism_(Condition)\" title=\"Invigorating Fanaticism (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invigorating Fanaticism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/BOOOAL%27s_Faithful_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invigorating_Fanaticism_(Condition)\" title=\"Invigorating Fanaticism (Condition)\">Invigorating Fanaticism</a> condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Chance to apply Bleeding to targets. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bleeding\"> Condition: Bleeding </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\"